# The deploy workflow runs `railway up` from the repo root so the uploaded
# snapshot contains the `api/` folder the Railway service's Root Directory
# points at. Only api/ is built, so keep the upload lean by excluding the
# repo's documentation and local-dev files. Do NOT ignore api/.
# .git is excluded first: it's large, irrelevant to the build, and shipping repo
# history into the build context is needless bloat (and a minor info-leak).
/.git
/FleetOS-Playbook
/docs
/.github
/scripts
/README.md
/CLAUDE.md
/docker-compose.yml
